  "details": "For those of us unable to use spout2, it would be nice if the stream camera was able to be shown in a second window on the desktop that could then be captured by obs to use as avatar/view overlay, or to keep track of what's going on in your immediate vicinity, or whatever. I imagine there could be quite a few use cases for it. \n\n(I currently use a transparent personal mirror in a corner for keeping track of who's near me but out of view, and also to show my avatar on screen whenever I stream. It's... quite confusing at times since it's at a pretty bad angle and overlapping my main view, which in both cases a second window with the camera view would be the perfect solution for.)",
